Z||000000||mrfiero||07-20-2001||05:45 PM||||I just thought I'd share my latest good fortune with you all.  I just got back from a junkyard here in Denver that has an '88 coupe.  It had an '88 GT nose and brand new calipers and rotors!  I got them with the upper control arms for a little over $100 total.  The calipers were $8 each and the rotors were $7 each.  Not bad!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I'm going back tomorrow for the steering rack, rear links, spindles and lower control arms......I ran out of time & money today. <P>Anywho......I just thought I'd tell someone.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
